sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant BC as BankController<br/>(L0调度层)
    participant DR as DomainRouter<br/>(意图路由)
    participant L1 as AbstractDomainService<br/>(L1领域服务)
    participant GEE as GraphExecutionEngine<br/>(L2子图执行)
    participant OM as ObservabilityMetrics<br/>(Micrometer)
    participant OC as OTel Collector<br/>(:4318)
    participant OB as 可观测后端<br/>(:9090)
    participant OF as 可观测前端<br/>(:3000)

    U->>BC: POST /api/bank/chat {sessionId, message}
    activate BC
    BC->>BC: setAttribute(session.id, user.id)
    BC->>BC: setAttribute(agent.level, "L0")
    
    BC->>DR: route(sessionId, userInput)
    activate DR
    DR->>OM: recordIntentRecognized(intent, confidence)
    DR-->>BC: DomainResult{domain: "TRANSFER"}
    deactivate DR
    
    BC->>L1: handle(sessionId, userInput)
    activate L1
    L1->>L1: setAttribute(agent.level, "L1")
    
    opt L1改写
        L1->>L1: rewrite(userInput)
        L1->>OM: recordRewriteTotal()
        L1->>OM: recordRewriteAccuracy(rate)
    end
    
    L1->>GEE: executeGraph(graph, intent, input, threadId)
    activate GEE
    GEE->>GEE: setAttribute(agent.level, "L2")
    GEE->>GEE: startWorkflowTimer()
    
    Note over GEE: LLM调用 (qwen-plus)
    GEE->>GEE: recordFirstTokenTime(ttft)
    GEE->>GEE: stopLlmTimer()
    
    GEE->>GEE: checkGraphResult()
    GEE->>GEE: setAttribute(business.outcome, "success")
    GEE->>OM: recordBusinessSuccess()
    GEE-->>L1: Flux<StreamChunk>
    deactivate GEE
    
    L1-->>BC: Flux<StreamChunk>
    deactivate L1
    
    opt REROUTE检测
        BC->>BC: addEvent("reroute.triggered")
        BC->>DR: 重新路由(排除当前域)
    end
    
    BC-->>U: SSE流式响应
    deactivate BC

    Note over OM,OC: OTLP数据管道
    OM->>OC: Metrics/Traces/Logs (gRPC :4318)
    OC->>OB: HTTP POST /api/v1/otlp/v1/*
    OB->>OB: OtlpParserService → H2/Redis

    Note over OF,OB: 前端查询
    loop 每3秒
        OF->>OB: GET /api/v1/metrics/realtime
        OB->>OB: Redis 滑动窗口 → RealtimeMetricsVO
        OB-->>OF: 20字段KPI数据
    end

    OF->>OB: GET /api/v1/sessions
    OB->>OB: H2 sessions表
    OB-->>OF: 会话列表

    OF->>OB: GET /api/v1/sessions/{id}
    OB->>OB: H2 sessions + session_turns
    OB-->>OF: 会话详情(turns+timeline)

    OF->>OB: GET /api/v1/traces
    OB->>OB: H2 spans表
    OB-->>OF: Trace列表

    OF->>OB: GET /api/v1/traces/{traceId}
    OB->>OB: TraceQueryService.buildSpanTree()
    OB-->>OF: Span层级树+IO
